# =============================================================================
# Skill-HQE — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Keep the /HQE skill repository free of local state, caches, generated audit
#   artifacts, secrets, packaging debris, editor files, and transient build
#   output.
#
# Important:
#   - Lockfiles are intentionally NOT ignored.
#   - .github/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
#   - Test fixtures may intentionally contain fake secrets, .env files, ignored
#     files, or otherwise suspicious content; explicit exceptions are provided
#     near the end of this file.
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS / Finder
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.TemporaryItems
.VolumeIcon.icns

# macOS archive/extraction metadata
__MACOSX/


